Shop for some of the most important items you'll ever carry—including the ideal sleeping bag for the outdoors, and some other gear as well—with us. If you're looking for a tent, sleeping bag, backpack, and even a hammock to go with it, we've got you covered:
Sleeping the night (or more) in your own backyard with a cozy new hammock is easier than ever with new products like ROOFINVENTTM, a tent-in-a-can system. You'll set it up and enjoy a good night's sleep in just a few minutes, and wake up to enjoy the sunrise at the same time — all thanks to patented air-filled cushioning, which ensures your hammock will never be broken or deflated and offers unparalleled support.
The outdoor industry has long been ahead of many others when it comes to tackling climate change and advancing the fight for a more sustainable world. For years, REI has been the number one outdoor retailer and environmental activist, with a core mission to inspire people to enjoy the outdoors while preserving it. Recently, some of that effort has manifested in a project called Reisnest—an eco-friendly way to build houses and houses to live in, and do it sustainably and locally.
